OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in 'traumatising'
OL,4,Astabbing named by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died after being stabbed in a
OL,7,Fbusy street has been named by police.
OL,9,FAbdillahi Farid Ali, 43, sustained
OL,10,Fknife wounds during an incident in
OL,11,FSmall Heath, Birmingham, on Wednesday
OL,12,Fafternoon and was declared dead at the
OL,13,Fscene.
OL,15,FA 46-year-old man was arrested nearby
OL,16,Fon suspicion of murder. Police said he
OL,17,Fremained in custody for questioning and
OL,18,Fthey were not currently looking for
OL,19,Fanyone else.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
