OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in 'traumatising'
OL,4,Astabbing named by police
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This was an extremely traumatising
OL,7,Fincident to witness, and we want to
OL,8,Fensure that people are aware of the
OL,9,Fsupport available to them," said Det
OL,10,FInsp Nick Barnes.
